@api = http://localhost:5080

### Sync any public profile (SteamID64, custom name, or profile URL)
POST {{api}}/api/profiles/sync
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "gabelogannewell" }

### Read a stored library
GET {{api}}/api/profiles/76561197960287930/library

### Update a backlog entry
PATCH {{api}}/api/profiles/76561197960287930/games/620/backlog
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Playing", "notes": "Co-op with Sam" }
